  <p>Visitors do not have accounts, and you cannot log in to promptbeen. A password-protected admin console exists for the site owner only, to add and edit prompts, web stories and images. You must not try to access it, guess its password or interfere with how it works. Failed login attempts are counted per IP address for a short time to block guessing, and we may block anyone who keeps trying.</p>
  <h2>Using prompts with ChatGPT</h2>
  <p>The prompts are written to be pasted into ChatGPT, but promptbeen does not run, host or control ChatGPT. Whether a prompt works depends on your OpenAI account and the features available to you. If ChatGPT refuses a request, changes how it behaves or limits your usage, that is a matter between you and OpenAI. Please follow OpenAI's usage policies, including its rules about uploading photos of other people.</p>
